  "htmlContent": "<p>因為雲端虛擬機不會包含本機的 <code>.env</code> 檔案，所以必須將金鑰存放在 GitHub 儲存庫的 <strong>Secrets</strong> 裡面供腳本讀取。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/notion/4113eb21-f1cc-80d4-97e4-ef3788bdfa16-1.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>需要以下兩個金鑰，點上圖綠色新增即可。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_API_KEY</strong></code></li>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_DATABASE_ID</strong></code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/31682f85-b904-4805-902e-18126780c624/3a3210e3-1b45-4e6f-9c69-03f97fe5894c/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466YM73P3SC%2F20261126%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20261126T063641Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEO3%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIHRV5R7RkBIdgc433V530%2FD%2Bf3zgu%2BG1EcjdDV0Zz1CGAiEA9ZBil9bARseGLjE2%2B2wZZXvYKrn8fb%2B1ITB%2FGwgNs4AqiAQItf%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAAGgw2Mzc0MjMxODM4MDUiDO8rqZkDPnDdpzt9MCrcA1%2F79nKus6k6dHlibno1o2YKJENmExVNXI8QEyLg1laJmWD0eQeYDtBmpjA78k1HfY%2BipXpc3hM%2Fo77tR1dUyraqxv%2FubptQfXndoAN7NlPRKz6%2BUDE19n7zOg4gvxPLqdHFYpXO3ldpiHNRnnszLRQSDyEPuHGSLkIQO%2BE%2FLMmqIAtxoFjQ9gVz4NXv7F50IcP2lbBLt16dF1C%2BiVxQ0kDcj5vZGTMUNxLjVqJFFPtda%2B8c5Li%2BQB0kQ1Kea%2Bg6jOnoxj82673muRHHboT7pFiznCCnjGvrF98SgfNnzkmoG72dxz3qTa6nyqbvdB2T%2B50qOwfejY02lJ2snKUC6hgvFFlc2C256fhf5Ur2sxyTuq%2FfUAa1FedZjL0ykyoi%2Fv85XSvrlJOj0xIjQZnv%2Bv9%2BJLtDsD0Q53CTya3wi0KzplW8I8ZlIz0VX3PvJ0N%2Fx9RK7508AcyIZCuMHfTBVeQ6QXjSM41MHCLFDXAiiLRAun5aoG5NOtFqncJVB8gXBwfRfYpRpQZA3BEgsfoF6Okw1%2Fgqjt65YyE2Qd0DRf7iAikzhxHKmNLeTv4puKJDiWwZ1hZsU3Qyk2vZiEDHH2PERKR%2FdI6gTmC5rHytDINviloJIPNeKB8%2BFAMvMIvyntgGOqUBwyAxWvv3MuHBqnI4jTC8gvgoZwquZhaCkIbL66mbJIq2E90zc4tbvAgGZ0Iq4rrArpPhiidD8Hzv3vzWhkWbaLIp%2F27GqiAEiFRFpjav0dxkr1fh%2F40nEgFgHsAI2W4W7ANBNxriRgTGBgV%2B%2FoXvDyi%2BOQ8hMRxp8FvRd%2B%2BA0NziSVyrboUNDwIZcOJjERghwyHXBairLLS3ut5ecAxFQS2PjNVu&amp;X-Amz-Signature=6e9e76d4fd8e6daf9cb4bec386686b69ca8dd2